r race  three years ago alenka manual says the  NX radiator grill isn't for everyone and  the alternating convex and concave shape  is tough to produce some said it was too  pricey for series production but lexus  did it will excellence at schoo shaft  was he doesn't give miss all the RCF  also sports the lexus diabolo radiator  grille developed in 2014 the car is a  further development of the RC sports  coupe a the F stands for the Fuji  International Speedway where Lexus  tested the car's performance the high  performance sport versions of the RC are  also F models  European competitors are now following  the Japanese brands lead and making the  kind of hybrid engine that have become a  Lexus trademark  the Lamborghini 350gt  back in 1964 the first sports car  branded with the bull logo came onto the  market its mission to run rings around  Ferraris horse  a good long smooth our classy car expert  Cousteau Bauer says the legend  surrounding the birth of the Lamborghini  350 GT is one of the most famous  anecdotes in automotive history  ferruccio lamborghini owned a profitable  tractor factory and a ferrari 250 GT but  he wasn't really happy with the car and  told Enzo Ferrari why right to his face  Ferrari retorted that Lamborghini should  stick to making tractors Lamborghini was  so angry that he founded his own company  automobile II Lamborghini and introduced  his own supercard the 350 GT the new  company was based in sant'agata  bolognese and italy's emilia-romagna  region barely 20 kilometers away from  Ferraris headquarters at Maranello and  that's where the ambitious Ferruccio  Lamborghini poached his top managers  from dr. kristov says there's a world of  distance between tractors and super cars  but ferruccio lamborghini was very lucky  that at the time Ferraris development  department was in a dispute with their  boss so Lamborghini was able to hire  away three of Ferraris best technicians  they developed the 350 GT and left  Ferrari eating their dust th